Package: vertexR
Title: Graph Exploration, Simulation, and Optimization for Ontology-Backed System Graphs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Cathal", "Byrne", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cathal@example.com")
Description: Turns ontology specifications into interconnected system graphs
    for exploration, alerting, what-if simulation, and optimization. Built on
    ontologySpecR bundles and DBI connections, vertexR materializes object
    instances as nodes and link instances as edges, enabling graph-based
    analysis of cause-and-effect across any domain.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 3.6)
Imports:
    ontologySpecR,
    DBI,
    igraph,
    tidygraph,
    dplyr,
    rlang
Suggests:
